65
00:02:13,180 --> 00:02:14,700
So you might say, well, look, there's

66
00:02:14,700 --> 00:02:15,700
not perfect information.

67
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:17,260
There's some adverse selection.

68
00:02:17,260 --> 00:02:19,100
There isn't any reason to prevent insurance companies

